  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-105",
  "title": "Screenshot Analysis",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Screenshot Analysis"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Based on the screenshot analysis, here’s a summary of the Svelte app UI:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "• It’s branded as “Acme Inc Enterprise” and features a clean, modern dashboard style."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "• There’s a left sidebar with a dark gray background, featuring white icons and text. This sidebar includes the app logo and name at the top, followed by several groupings of navigation items (like Platform, Projects, and others) with collapsible categories. The current active item “Data Fetching” (under the “Building Your Application” category) is highlighted."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "• The main content area on the right is predominantly white and includes a breadcrumb navigation at the top, indicating the current page context."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "• The color scheme relies on a mix of dark gray, white, and a blue accent for highlights, creating a simple yet effective visual hierarchy."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "• Interactive elements include expandable/collapsible menu items in the sidebar and clickable breadcrumb links."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This overall design suggests an effective documentation or admin dashboard style, optimized for clear navigation and ease of use. Let me know if you need further analysis or any next steps"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}